# Python 3.12 & FastAPI Rules

## API Design & Pydantic
- Use FastAPI async route handlers (`async def`).
- Use Pydantic v2 `BaseModel` for all request bodies and response schemas.
- Provide clear docstrings and descriptions for OpenAPI schema generation.

## Tool Calling & LLM Fallbacks
- LangChain / OpenAI tool definitions live in `src/tools/`.
- Ensure mock LLM provider (`LLM_PROVIDER=mock`) remains supported so tests can run offline without API keys.
- Stream tokens using `StreamingResponse` with `media_type="text/event-stream"`.

## Testing
- Tests are located in `tests/test_ai_service.py`.
- Run tests via `pytest` inside the container:
  `docker exec food-platform-ai-service pytest tests/`
